# HireLens — Future Scope

## Overview

HireLens v1.0.0 provides a functional foundation for resume analysis, ATS compatibility scoring, job matching, missing-skill detection, keyword analysis, AI suggestions, and PDF reporting.

The next stage should focus on improving analysis quality, reliability, user experience, security, and scalability.

